      ],
      "source": "https://villageofgoreville.gov/the-village/goreville-history/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Before 1899, early residents like William Terry, Wes Gore, and Thomas McCormick helped build the community’s first general store.",
